{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14118","headline":"泾州观元戎出师 · 戎昱","name":"泾州观元戎出师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒日征西将，萧萧万马丛。\n吹笳覆楼雪，祝纛满旗风。\n遮虏黄云断，烧羌白草空。\n金铙肃天外，玉帐静霜中。\n朔野长城闭，河源旧路通。\n卫青师自老，魏绦赏何功。\n枪垒依沙迥，辕门压塞雄。\n燕然如可勒，万里愿从公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}